{"parse": {"title": "雏鸟为何坠落-01", "pageid": 141884, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">雏鸟为何坠落-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%8F%E9%B8%9F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%9D%A0%E8%90%BD-02\" title=\"雏鸟为何坠落-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">雏鸟为何坠落</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AF.BB.E9.AC.BC.E5.90.AF.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"寻鬼启事\">寻鬼启事</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 寻鬼启事</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Shade Search</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/Cg-3_8_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正午的阳光均匀地洒在室内，新漆的黑白格子反射着柔和的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>台后的文员将又一份文件推到建筑师面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哈哈，我希望这是我需要签署的最后一份文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我有时会思考这样的问题：如果我们将流程中产生的所有文件收集起来，它们会不会足以建成一栋纸质基金会大楼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她匆匆扫了几眼说明，便在右下角签上了自己的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>文员收回文件，最后一次仔细比对申请表上的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>嗯……所以您将返回总部，并在那里提交一位新人调查员的入职申请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>而在这段时间内，这位新人会暂时居住在诺瓦米奇办事处的客房中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>因为她没有固定住所，而且她……需要适应有人的环境？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>文员狐疑的目光绕过奠基石，看向站在她身后的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这位金发女孩在原地轻轻摇晃着，似乎没有注意她们的谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当陌生的目光投来时，她微微睁大了双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石咳嗽了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我想这份申请不会耗时太长。我之前便已经和那些大人物汇报过这位新人的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>最多半个月。一切结束后，我会立刻返回这里，将她带回总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩忽然开口插入了这段对话——就像终于接上了一段电波。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我们要离开这里吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>是的，就像我们之前聊过的那样……如果你愿意的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们曾经失去过你。我很高兴你回到了我们身边，再次成为了我们的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石的面庞闪过一丝柔和的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你与之前一样，却又不同……或许这是某类神秘学家的特性……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她止住话头，思考了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在总部，我们可以仔细调查这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>总部……你说那里有许许多多的声音，也有许多新朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>是的。这两年，基金会已经协助安置了几位愿意离开这里的“鬼魂”。他们对于新家的评价总体还是正面的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>建成办事处后，这栋建筑……有了别的作用，不再像之前那么适合游荡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>文员将资料放入文件袋中，缠上了归档的绳子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>可以了。幸好这是个新成立的办事处，我们还有很多空房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣看见文员从墙上取下一大串钥匙，走到自己面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>来吧。这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣对着即将分别的建筑师点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>再见，奠基石女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……等等！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>回声谣，你想起之前发生的事情了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那场“暴雨”，之前来看望过你的奥尔加、亚肖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>还有消失的卢齐安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我上个月才变成了人的样子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>在这之前，我只是一束光……对一切的记忆都是模模糊糊的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你和我讲的许多事……我毫无印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我已经问过了这里的“鬼魂”，它们之中……没有叫作卢齐安的男孩。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">文员：</div><div>这里刚装修完不久，或许还有些呛人的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>喔……希望它不会呛到我的雏菊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门把手转动的声音、门合上的声音……文员的脚步声渐渐远去了，回声谣躺倒在柔软的床上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忍耐许久的手偶从她手上跳开，大声开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣，我们不能走！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她陷在云一样的床垫里，思绪也飘开了。但这丝毫没有阻挡朋友控诉的热情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>这是我们的家！呃，虽然不知道我们为什么成了这副样子，之前的事也不记得……但这毫无疑问就是我们的家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>不知道什么时候，那些人忽然闯进来，这里敲，那里打——现在这里到处都是黑白格子了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>可是……建筑没有拒绝这次改造。砖石和“鬼魂”都很平静，我能感觉到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>改造完成后，人们也都很高兴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>就算如此！他们也不能撵走我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>不是撵走，是邀请……去一个新地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吵闹的朋友安静了一瞬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣，你想走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嘈杂的低语声骤然涌入了回声谣的脑海，盖过了她原本的思维痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“鬼魂”：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:194%\">离开这里，离开这里……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“鬼魂”：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:222%\">不要打扰我们。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣直起身子，摇了摇脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣，你怎么啦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>是大家……“鬼魂”们……它们有些不安，似乎有人闯了进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>是东边……有几个“鬼魂”喜欢待在那里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Cg-3_8_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一处尚未被脚手架与油漆桶入侵的角落，曾是流民们的安身之所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今，它安静地荒废于此，只剩下“鬼魂”在天井下游荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，“鬼魂”们聚在一起，围住了中间穿着黑白格子的人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>她的穿着……很像那位拿着一大串钥匙的女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哎呀，你们该冷静一点，我只是来找个人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个婴儿的“鬼魂”正在啃食不速之客的裤脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“鬼魂”：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:250%\">离开……离开……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这里就没有能听懂人话的“鬼魂”吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他们明明说这里的“鬼魂”能说能唱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣飘到近处，哼唱起一首不知名的小调，安抚下“鬼魂”们躁动不安的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>大家不要害怕……她不是魔鬼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>让我来和她说说话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低沉的威吓声渐渐消隐，“鬼魂”们为她让出了一条通路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陌生的基金会职员松了口气，上下打量她几眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>终于来了个能沟通的女鬼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>喔……我不叫这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>这真是个没礼貌的笨蛋！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘿，别激动，小朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>本地人都知道这里闹鬼。“鬼魂”这东西，在外面只是传说……在这栋建筑里却随处可见！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>也有人说，这些“鬼魂”其实不是鬼，而是回声什么的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不过，这里改造为基金会办事处之后，你得找些偏僻角落，才能看到这些“鬼魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>大家平时不会出去，你也不该来到这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我们都应该生活在各自的岛上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手偶用力前后摇摆着脑袋，仿佛在极力赞成回声谣的说法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>按照海岛的传统，闯入者应该首先自报家门！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>你到底是谁？偷偷跑到这里想要做什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员叹了口气，在具有奇特光泽的石头上坐下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我不是小偷，这里也不是审讯室……不过，你们帮我解了围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我是祖赞娜，一周前入职了基金会诺瓦米奇办事处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我来这里找一个与你一样的……“鬼魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>一些人说，对这栋建筑执念深重的人，死后会被困在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>如果是一个在这栋建筑中死去的人呢？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "雏鸟为何坠落-01"}}